{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "213fc6fb-e977-8c6e-a00a-6a5c03de4388",
  "created_at": "2026-01-23T13:37:59-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Wilson Rocha",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:34:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance department, this is Luis. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:34:43-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good afternoon. My name is Wilson Rocha. I got a parking ticket in the mail, well, it was on my windshield, and I want to fight it. It's a ticket I don't think I earned."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:34:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Rocha. Happy to point you in the right direction. What was the ticket for?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:35:02-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Overnight parking, they say. Now I was parked in front of my own house, same spot I've been parking for thirty years, and some fella writes me up like I'm a tourist. It's the kind of thing that gets under my skin, I'll tell you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:35:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I hear that one fairly often. Do you have the ticket in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:35:24-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do, I do. Hold on, my glasses are, um, here we go. Ticket number is, it's got a letter first, then a lot of numbers."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:35:33-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, you don't need to read it all to me right now. What I can do is tell you how it works. Mostly you want to know how to contest it and what the hearing looks like, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:35:47-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. How do I contest it, and what's this hearing business? Do I have to stand up in front of somebody?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:35:55-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can. Generally you can ask for a hearing, and you go in and explain your side to a hearing officer, bring your photos or whatever backs you up. Or you can do it in writing and skip the trip. Either way there's a deadline printed on the ticket, so look at that first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:36:14-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The deadline. Hm. Let me see. [pause] Yes, it's on the back, small as an ant's handwriting. Alright, I think I'd rather write it. I'm not much for sitting in a room."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:36:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Write down your name, the ticket number, the plate, and why you think it's wrong. Sign it and include any pictures."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:36:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And where do I send it? Is it to City Hall, or some other place?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:36:39-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mail it to the City of Newport, Finance Department, parking ticket appeals, at City Hall on Broadway. You can also drop it off at the counter during business hours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:36:49-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, Finance, City Hall, Broadway. I'm writing that down. I can't really come by in the morning anyway. I bartend weekends, so I'm up till all hours Friday and Saturday, and I sleep late on weekdays. Mornings are no good for me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:37:04-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then mail's your friend. Afternoons we're open too, so if you change your mind, come by after lunch. Just don't let the deadline slip by while you're sleeping in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:37:14-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha. Well, I'll get it out Monday. Does it stop the fine from growing while they look at it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:37:21-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't tell you exactly how the late charges are handled on an open appeal. If you want, I'll note your number and have someone in the parking office call you back. Is the one you're on the best one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:37:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-seven. Landline, so leave a message if I don't answer. I may be napping."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:37:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-seven. I'll pass it along."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:37:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Luis. I appreciate you walking me through it. Still think it's a lousy ticket."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:37:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Put that in the letter. Have a good weekend, Mr. Rocha."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:37:57-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
